WEBVTT

00:00:01.390 --> 00:00:03.620
Understand why Aria says to wait.

00:00:04.890 --> 00:00:07.410
Begin by checking the market and timeframe.

00:00:08.390 --> 00:00:10.680
Open Aria to inspect its checks.

00:00:11.890 --> 00:00:14.820
Read the market conditions before looking at
the score.

00:00:15.682 --> 00:00:18.012
A passed gate means one rule matched.

00:00:19.182 --> 00:00:21.212
Now read a condition that failed.

00:00:22.682 --> 00:00:25.312
Read the verdict, including any restriction.

00:00:26.182 --> 00:00:29.032
Ask what evidence would invalidate this
idea.

00:00:29.890 --> 00:00:33.100
In this example, we wait and leave the
ticket alone.

00:00:33.973 --> 00:00:38.443
Bring your reasoning to the lesson. Matching
checks cannot guarantee results.
